From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 23:51:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(docs): quote the reworded incomplete-model message in
 troubleshooting

The incomplete-model refusal is a format string in mesh_open.rs. The
troubleshooting heading still quoted the old closed-shell literal, so
troubleshooting_messages_still_exist_in_the_sources failed on main.
The heading now quotes the fixed text the sources print.

Fixes #2051

Co-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
